hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1171","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne Umar bin Khattab ko ek sawar giroh mein paya jabke Umar apne walid ki qasam kha rahe the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen pukara: Khabardar! Beshak Allah tumhen mana karta hai ke apne baapon ki qasmen khao; to jo qasam khane wala ho woh Allah ki qasam khae ya khamosh rahe. Muttafaq alaih; aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ki ek riwayat mein Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai: Apne baapon ki qasmen na khao, na apni maaon ki, na shareekon ki; aur Allah ke siwa qasam na khao; aur Allah ki qasam na khao magar jab tum sachche ho."
"1172","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari qasam us par hai jis par tumhara sathi tumhari tasdeeq kare. Aur ek riwayat mein hai: Qasam qasam dilane wale ki niyyat par hai. Dono ko Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1173","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur jab tum kisi qasam par qasam khao, phir us ke siwa behtar dekho to apni qasam ka kaffara do aur jo behtar hai use karo. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke ek lafz mein hai: To jo behtar hai use karo aur apni qasam ka kaffara do. Aur Abu Dawud ki ek riwayat mein hai: To apni qasam ka kaffara do, phir jo behtar hai use karo. Aur is ki sanad sahih hai."
"1174","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi qasam par qasam khae aur kahe: Agar Allah ne chaha, to us par hins nahin hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1175","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qasam thi: Nahin, dilon ko pherne wale ki qasam! Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kabira gunah kya hain?... Phir hadees zikr ki, aur is mein hai ke main ne kaha: Aur jhooti doobne wali qasam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jo Musalman aadmi ka maal kaat le jabke woh us mein jhoota ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul 'Allah tumhen tumhari laghw qasmon par nahin pakdega' [Surah Baqarah: 225] ke bare mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh aadmi ka qaul hai: Nahin, Allah ki qasam; kyun, Allah ki qasam. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ne ise marfoo'an zikr kiya."
"1178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke ninnanwe naam hain, jo unhen yaad kare woh jannat mein dakhil hoga. Muttafaq alaih; aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne naamon ko chalaya, aur tehqeeq hai ke un ka silsila ba'z rawiyon ka idraj hai."
"1179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se neki ki jae aur woh karne wale se kahe: Allah tumhen khair de, to us ne sana mein mubalagha kiya. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne nazr se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Beshak woh khair nahin lati, us se siwae kanjoos se nikalwaya jata hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1181","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nazr ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ne is mein izafa kiya: Jab naam na le, aur ise sahih kaha. Aur Abu Dawud ke han Ibn Abbas ki marfoo' hadees se hai: Jo nazr mane jise us ne naam na diya ho to us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai; aur jo gunah mein nazr mane to us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai; aur jo nazr mane jis ki taqat na rakhe to us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai."
"1182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke meri bahan ne nazr mani ke Baitullah tak nange pair chalegi. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh chale aur sawar ho. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur Khamsa ke han hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhari bahan ki mashaqqat se kuch nahin karta; use hukm do ke dupatta odhe, sawar ho aur teen din roze rakhe."
"1183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Sa'd bin Ubadah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us nazr ke bare mein fatwa manga jo un ki walidah par thi, woh us ke poora karne se pahle wafat pa gayin thin? To Aap ne farmaya: Use un ki taraf se poora karo. Muttafaq alaih."
"1184","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sabit bin Dahhak (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein nazr mani ke Buwanah mein unt zabah karega. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya us mein koi but tha jis ki ibadat ki jati thi? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Kya us mein un ki eidon mein se koi eid thi? Us ne kaha: Nahin. To Aap ne farmaya: Apni nazr poori karo; kyunke Allah ki nafarmani mein nazr poori nahin hoti, na qata' rehmi mein, na us mein jis ka Adam ka beta malik na ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tabarani ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Tabarani ke hain, aur yeh sahih sanad wala hai; aur is ka shahid Kardam ki hadees se Ahmad ke han hai."
"1185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Fath ke din kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne nazr mani thi ke agar Allah Aap par Makkah fath kare to main Bait al-Maqdis mein namaz padhunga. To Aap ne farmaya: Yahan namaz padho. To us ne poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Yahan namaz padho. To us ne poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhara mamla hai. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Sawariyan siwae teen masajid ke kasi na jaen: Masjid Haram, Masjid Aqsa aur meri masjid. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"1187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne Jahiliyah mein nazr mani thi ke Masjid Haram mein ek raat e'tikaf karunga. Aap ne farmaya: Apni nazr poori karo. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ne ek riwayat mein izafa kiya ke ek raat e'tikaf kiya."
